entic, engaging education without travel, without borders, and with unlimited possibilities. Join us and be part of the future of learning.", "short_description": "Immersive VR classroom with live teachers, interactive board, and personal notebooks \u2013 real education without borders."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "2907926936080689", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2907926939414022_765797073903788866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bb2wUOp9_3cQ7kNvwF54d2s&_nc_oc=AdqyVxAlTUyKknk7ZPrmd8efCwzIDczMigPDRmgeFWE1o8X4f7I5mGbQ6bvCaJeKkqY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWV6GnECtTdLQ9Uslx0Ck4dRbRdR6VF_JLehsJE2gnY0Q&oe=6B0F136F"}, {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1863250024613411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_1863250027946744_9021948593827972383_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sAXvr0VCoC4Q7kNvwER885W&_nc_oc=AdpcOwmO4e80T3isXVWa7DvyEBoBcCT1tZDTfa8lUU759XXtT-1Hg6E2hkcR8btMxDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV4n1IV46o7VScD_0C5Ds3MCnS1vHlLZv7IBV9Eg_5zuA&oe=6B0EF9AD"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogo.png", "id": "1354178952944489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1354178956277822_7078438908620814251_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BVHZtNExXN0Q7kNvwE1p0Qh&_nc_oc=Adpp6VHu4cBhVtW4VYlEYh7i5GUclGK8umEnFK4thXDYmqYkgJP2B2reL1BOqLCwZJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWCiLlYz-LM000fRcSsbsl2ln86fmYIA78IQXw-qqZhPA&oe=6B0EF1B9"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogotrans.png", "id": "1305409841177830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49